(6897226, 1039076, 138630, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge - I love the light filtering through the loose weave of the burlap  - and those are great looking vegetables.  May not be enough about the store for some, but it''s very pleasing.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge - I love the light filtering through the loose weave of the burlap  - and those are great looking vegetables.  May not be enough about the store for some, but it''s very pleasing.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-03 16:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897227, 1039282, 138630, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks - great lines and repeating patterns and the heavy frost adds nice texture and interest.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'One of my top picks - great lines and repeating patterns and the heavy frost adds nice texture and interest.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-03 16:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897228, 1039232, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nice lens choice to bring interest to a challenge topic that apparently didn''t have much.  I especially like being able to see all the way down the street on the left side of the frame.  The clerk behind the counter is a nice touch, too.  Small matter because it almost is, but I''m wondering why you didn''t go black and white?  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Nice lens choice to bring interest to a challenge topic that apparently didn''t have much.  I especially like being able to see all the way down the street on the left side of the frame.  The clerk behind the counter is a nice touch, too.  Small matter because it almost is, but I''m wondering why you didn''t go black and white?  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-03 16:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897230, 1039263, 138630, '<td valign="top">At least you had permission LOL  They look slightly ill at ease but are probably pleased you wanted to take the picture.  That''s a lot of junk - candy, high energy drinks, cigarettes . . . Very glad for the conversion to black and white :)  Voted earlier.</td>', 'At least you had permission LOL  They look slightly ill at ease but are probably pleased you wanted to take the picture.  That''s a lot of junk - candy, high energy drinks, cigarettes . . . Very glad for the conversion to black and white :)  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-03 16:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897231, 1039089, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nice environment portrait though the lighting was not kind to either of you.  Good score from me.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Nice environment portrait though the lighting was not kind to either of you.  Good score from me.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-03 16:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897232, 1038940, 138630, '<td valign="top">I find this one of the more interesting entries in the challenge.  Wish the light was not so harsh.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'I find this one of the more interesting entries in the challenge.  Wish the light was not so harsh.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-03 16:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897233, 1039352, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and a story, too.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice lines and a story, too.  Well done.', '2012-11-03 16:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897242, 1039250, 138630, '<td valign="top">The colors and light are nice though I find the bright bit on the left at the top distracting and I can''t decide whether the water bottle is distracting or adds a nice bit of whimsy to an otherwise exotic (to me) image.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'The colors and light are nice though I find the bright bit on the left at the top distracting and I can''t decide whether the water bottle is distracting or adds a nice bit of whimsy to an otherwise exotic (to me) image.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-03 17:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897244, 1039324, 138630, '<td valign="top">I love the scene - one of my favorite captures in the challenge.  However, I don''t like the processing at all - it seems to muddy things up considerably.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'I love the scene - one of my favorite captures in the challenge.  However, I don''t like the processing at all - it seems to muddy things up considerably.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-03 17:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897246, 1039331, 138630, '<td valign="top">Wondered whether anyone would find a tyke with one of these little carts.  Just wish she was either looking at you or caught on the profile and that she looked a little busier (ie had stuff in her cart, was pushing it).  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Wondered whether anyone would find a tyke with one of these little carts.  Just wish she was either looking at you or caught on the profile and that she looked a little busier (ie had stuff in her cart, was pushing it).  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-03 17:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897259, 1039157, 3216, '<td valign="top">Not really a grocery/convenience store, eh?</td>', 'Not really a grocery/convenience store, eh?', '2012-11-03 18:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897307, 1039289, 16106, '<td valign="top">A bit more street and feet would have really helped this. It is vibrant and busy, but feels ungrounded, it is the shoppers that make this image and your framing marginalizes them.</td>', 'A bit more street and feet would have really helped this. It is vibrant and busy, but feels ungrounded, it is the shoppers that make this image and your framing marginalizes them.', '2012-11-03 19:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897309, 1039324, 16106, '<td valign="top">A bit of a heavy hand on the editing, but what you have is lovely, I just wish the image let me feel a bit more of the presence of the place and less editorially removed. still, one of the best so far.</td>', 'A bit of a heavy hand on the editing, but what you have is lovely, I just wish the image let me feel a bit more of the presence of the place and less editorially removed. still, one of the best so far.', '2012-11-03 19:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897312, 1039311, 16106, '<td valign="top">A very nice capture, but it seems so isolated that i wish you had left a bit more room around the margins to isolate it more. As is with the guy standing stoically in the door way, it is one of the top handfull.</td>', 'A very nice capture, but it seems so isolated that i wish you had left a bit more room around the margins to isolate it more. As is with the guy standing stoically in the door way, it is one of the top handfull.', '2012-11-03 19:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6897314, 1039161, 16106, '<td valign="top">the sort of blurry desat i don''t ususaly care for and you can''t see much of the store, yet it so well captures the hectic shopping of an urban area that it demands to be in the top 2.</td>', 'the sort of blurry desat i don''t ususaly care for and you can''t see much of the store, yet it so well captures the hectic shopping of an urban area that it demands to be in the top 2.', '2012-11-03 19:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
