(6898950, 1039312, 62318, '<td valign="top">Good lines, good use of the frame, and good eye movement. <br/>If I had to nit-pick I would say get rid of the guy on the right (as he does not add too much). Unless you were looking for that same kind of head pose that both seem to mimic.<br/>Wonderful contrasts, I would have thought this would have done much better.</td>', 'Good lines, good use of the frame, and good eye movement. If I had to nit-pick I would say get rid of the guy on the right (as he does not add too much). Unless you were looking for that same kind of head pose that both seem to mimic.Wonderful contrasts, I would have thought this would have done much better.', '2012-11-05 15:46:33.000000', NULL, 0),
