(7261869, 1039263, 60173, '<td valign="top">There''s a really good chance I played a part in that barcode scanner getting into that store. Unfortunately, since that scanner is almost in the center of the photo and I worked for the company that made that scanner, that''s all I see. My eyes keep springing back to it! In fact, I hold some hostility toward it. Rawr!</td>', 'There''s a really good chance I played a part in that barcode scanner getting into that store. Unfortunately, since that scanner is almost in the center of the photo and I worked for the company that made that scanner, that''s all I see. My eyes keep springing back to it! In fact, I hold some hostility toward it. Rawr!', '2014-09-10 21:55:16.000000', NULL, 0);
